N0023,2016-04-03,world,Panama Papers leak exposes offshore financial dealings,"A coordinated investigation by journalists published millions of leaked documents from Panamanian law firm Mossack Fonseca. The files detailed offshore companies linked to politicians, celebrities and business figures worldwide.",TRUE,Real event (summarised from public reporting)
