N1097,2026-10-19,health,"Scientists in New York 'confirm' onion juice reverses asthma, say sources","According to sources close to a research team, a study has quietly confirmed that onion juice can reverse asthma. The researchers, who asked not to be named, said the findings were being kept from the public. No journal, institution or data was provided.",FAKE,"Synthetic (blog post, fictional): WakeUpNow Network"
N1098,2026-10-21,politics,Top official in Hyderabad arrested for taking Rs 473 crore bribe? Media silent,"A post claims that a senior official in Hyderabad was arrested last night but that every news channel has been ordered to hide the story. It carries a blurry, undated photo and does not name any police station, court or case number. Fact-checkers found no record of any such arrest.",FAKE,"Synthetic (social media post, fictional): WakeUpNow Network"
